# Normalised to LF in the repository. Every copied kit on this machine hashed
# differently from every other one while being byte-identical in content,
# because Windows checkouts stored CRLF. A pin or a sync that compares content
# hashes cannot tell that apart from a real edit.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pptx binary
*.pdf binary
